define aquaculture as the intentional cultivation of aquatic life in harmony with nature—a regenerative approach to nourishing people while restoring ocean ecosystems.<\/p><p>It’s not just farming fish. It’s stewarding ecosystems, respecting animal welfare, and empowering communities through transparent, ethical, and science-backed practices.<\/p><p>We champion aquaculture that:<\/p><ul><li>Requires no wild fish in feed<\/li><li>Uses climate-smart, circular nutrition<\/li><li>Improves water quality and biodiversity<\/li><li>Respects animal sentience and the marine environment<\/li><li>Embeds equity and sustainability into every link of the supply chain<\/li><\/ul><p>This is aquaculture reimagined for a thriving planet—and it’s the future we’re scaling with every harvest.<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"rich_text_LgzxXB":{"type":"rich-text","settings":{"heading":"What is aquaculture, according to Seatopia?","text":"<p>At Seatopia, we define aquaculture as the intentional cultivation of aquatic life in harmony with nature—a regenerative approach to nourishing people while restoring ocean ecosystems.<\/p><p>It’s not just farming fish. It’s stewarding ecosystems, respecting animal welfare, and empowering communities through transparent, ethical, and science-backed practices.<\/p><p>We champion aquaculture that:<\/p><ul><li>Requires no wild fish in feed<\/li><li>Uses climate-smart, circular nutrition<\/li><li>Improves water quality and biodiversity<\/li><li>Respects animal sentience and the marine environment<\/li><li>Embeds equity and sustainability into every link of the supply chain<\/li><\/ul><p>This is aquaculture reimagined for a thriving planet—and it’s the future we’re scaling with every harvest.<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"contact_E94M3y":{"type":"contact","disabled":true,"settings":{"heading":"Didn’t find your answer?","text":"<p>Don't hestitate to contact us<\/p>","show_phone":false,"ava